{
  "name": "Juggler Style",
  "type": "skill",
  "system": {
    "description": "<p>This skill only produces an effect when you have only a single [Throwing] weapon equipped to a [Hand Slot]. You [Attack Power] becomes [Weapon's (Attack Power) x 2], and you can make [Ranged Attacks] in close range.</p>\n<p>(SR2): You gain a +2 bonus to [Accuracy].</p>\n<hr>\n<p>A fighting style that manipulates throwing weapons with splendid handling like an acrobat.</p>",
